{"brief": {"objective": "学生能说出 AVL 节点包含的字段，并描述递归插入的步骤", "learningAction": "inspect", "requiredEvidence": "学生能说出节点包含 height 字段，递归插入后更新高度并检查平衡", "keyClaim": "AVL 节点包含 value、left、right、height，递归插入后更新高度、计算平衡因子、必要时旋转", "misconception": "AVL 节点需要存储平衡因子而不是高度", "visualTask": "展示节点结构图和递归插入的伪代码", "evidencePolicy": "provided"}, "headline": "节点结构与递归插入", "lead": "每个节点存储值、左子、右子、高度。递归插入后更新高度并检查平衡。", "blocks": [{"type": "diagram", "diagramType": "connected-circles", "nodes": [{"title": "value", "sub": "节点存储的键值"}, {"title": "left", "sub": "左子节点指针"}, {"title": "right", "sub": "右子节点指针"}, {"title": "height", "sub": "以该节点为根的子树高度"}], "id": "b14"}, {"type": "code", "language": "python", "source": "class AVLNode:
    def __init__(self, value):
        self.value = value
        self.left = None
        self.right = None
        self.height = 1

def insert(root, value):
    if not root:
        return AVLNode(value)
    if value < root.value:
        root.left = insert(root.left, value)
    else:
        root.right = insert(root.right, value)
    root.height = 1 + max(get_height(root.left), get_height(root.right))
    balance = get_balance(root)
    if balance > 1 and value < root.left.value:
        return rotate_right(root)
    if balance < -1 and value > root.right.value:
        return rotate_left(root)
    if balance > 1 and value > root.left.value:
        root.left = rotate_left(root.left)
        return rotate_right(root)
    if balance < -1 and value < root.right.value:
        root.right = rotate_right(root.right)
        return rotate_left(root)
    return root", "filename": "avl_insert.py", "caption": "递归插入：先插入，再更新高度，最后检查平衡并旋转", "id": "b15"}]}

